OL,3,GNEWSALast firefighters stood down from
OL,4,Ascene of Cairngorms wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Fire and Rescue Service (SFRS)
OL,7,Fcrews have left the scene of a major
OL,8,Fwildfire that started in the Cairngorms
OL,9,FNational Park almost five weeks ago.
OL,11,FThe last 15 firefighters were stood
OL,12,Fdown at RSPB Abernethy Nature Reserve
OL,13,Fon Monday. RSPB staff continue to
OL,14,Fdampen down hotspots.
OL,16,FThe wildfire started in the Glenmore
OL,17,Farea, near Aviemore, on 15 July and it
OL,18,Fhas burned across about 10 sq miles (25
OL,19,Fsq km) of moorland and forestry.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
