OL,3,GNEWSALast firefighters stood down from
OL,4,Ascene of Cairngorms wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome homes and campsites had to be
OL,7,Fevacuated, and at the height of the
OL,8,Fincident more than 500 firefighters
OL,9,Fwere involved in the response.
